Scope

The MIT License above covers the code of this repository (mac/, lipread/,
federated/, tools/, design/ including the app icon) and its documentation, except for the parts that carry
their own license:

- mac/ is a fork of koe by Vincent Yang. koe's original notice is kept
  unchanged in mac/LICENSE.
- ios/ is based on GeminiKeyboardSample and is distributed under the
  Apache License 2.0 (full text in ios/LICENSE); the changes made to
  the sample are listed in ios/THIRD_PARTY.md.
- mac/vendor/lipflow/ (MIT, Amy Zhou; its espnet/ part Apache-2.0) and
  mac/vendor/mic-warm/ (MIT, Drew Burchfield) keep their own LICENSE files.
- Code ported from other projects is listed with its license in
  THIRD_PARTY.md, mac/THIRD_PARTY.md and ios/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
- The paintings used in the artwork (design/readme/*.jpg, the painting
  inside design/readme/banner.svg and the Mac About pane) are public-domain
  works by Vasnetsov, Roerich, Ryabushkin and Bilibin; THIRD_PARTY.md
  lists their sources.
- The bundled fonts Oglavie, Monomakh (fonts-cu, Aleksandr Andreev and
  Nikita Simmons) and Old Standard TT (mac/.../Fonts/, ios/App/Fonts/), and
  Vertograd used by the artwork generator (design/old-rus/fonts/), are under
  the SIL Open Font License 1.1, whose text sits next to them.

Model weights are not part of this repository and are not covered by this
license. MultiVSR has no license: its weights are downloaded from the authors
by lipread/download_weights.sh and are never redistributed here. See
THIRD_PARTY.md for models, datasets and services.
